          "quote": "Advanced single crystalline c/c¢ Co-base superalloys with at least nine alloying elements (Co-Ni-Al-W-Ta-Ti-Hf-Cr-Si-Re) were studied with the objective of achieving improved properties compared to previous Co-Al-W-based superalloys. The first alloy, ERBOCo-0, forms deleterious phases due to the low nickel content. Therefore, ERBOCo-1 was developed with a 12 at. pct higher Ni-content compared to ERBOCo-0 to widen the c/c¢ two–phase region.",
